resonant-session 2
length 9600
tempo 0 432000
loop 1920 5760 2
note 0 410 0 40 .78
note 840 410 0 52 .61
note 1440 335 0 55 .68
note 1920 420 0 45 .78
note 2640 260 0 57 .61
note 3360 420 0 60 .68
note 3920 275 0 62 .53
note 4320 390 0 57 .54
